@startuml
title Aveli — Database Knowledge Map

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  FontColor black
  RoundCorner 8
}
skinparam ArrowColor black

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Data Architecture\nOwnership / Lifecycle" as Architecture
rectangle "Conceptual Model\nSystem meaning" as Conceptual
rectangle "Logical Model\nAttributes / Relations / Cardinality" as Logical

rectangle "Local Stack\nSQLite + Drift" as LocalStack
rectangle "Server Stack\nPostgreSQL + Prisma" as ServerStack

rectangle "Local Persistence Usage\nPer-user SQLite + Files + Secure State" as Local
rectangle "Server Persistence Usage\nIdentity / Access / Billing / Events" as Server

Architecture --> Conceptual
Conceptual --> Logical

Logical --> LocalStack
Logical --> ServerStack

LocalStack --> Local : contextual usage
ServerStack --> Server : contextual usage

note bottom of Architecture
Defines responsibility before storage detail.
end note

note bottom of Logical
Technology-independent structure.
end note

note bottom of LocalStack
Canonical persistence technology
knowledge is documented first.
end note

note bottom of ServerStack
Canonical persistence technology
knowledge is documented first.
end note

note bottom of Local
Professional workspace data
is not synchronized to backend.
end note

note bottom of Server
Backend owns account,
access and subscription state.
end note

@enduml
